### Disclaimer

This software is provided for educational and demonstration purposes. While care has been taken to follow security best practices, this is a proof-of-concept project and should not be used in production environments without thorough security audits and additional hardening.

#### Security Notice
- This project has not undergone professional security auditing
- Smart contracts are immutable once deployed - test thoroughly before production use
- Users are responsible for securing their private keys and wallet credentials
- The authors are not liable for any loss of funds or data

#### Privacy Notice
- All data stored on the blockchain is publicly visible and permanent
- Users should not store sensitive personal information without proper encryption
- Email addresses and names stored on-chain can be viewed by anyone

